+  <div id="dashboard-status" class="status"></div>
+  <div class="panel"><h3>Pulltabs</h3><p class="muted">Sold/Week is normalized to three sessions per week using the most recent ten successfully processed sessions.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Game (Form #)</th><th>On Hand (Target)</th><th>Bundled (Target)</th><th>Sold/Week</th><th>Net Profit/$</th><th>Deals to Order</th></tr></thead><tbody id="dashboard-pt-rows"></tbody></table></div></div>
+  <div class="panel"><h3>Paper</h3><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Paper</th><th>Packs On Hand (Target)</th><th>Sold/Week</th><th>Net Profit/$</th><th>Cases to Order</th></tr></thead><tbody id="dashboard-paper-rows"></tbody></table></div></div>
